abstract: "A temporal load framework for predicting multi-drug combination nephrotoxicity risk, combining FAERS 2026Q3 kidney reporting signals, curated nephrotoxin labels, drug pharmacokinetics and a 24-hour concentration-time load model with renal-function (eGFR) scenarios."
keywords:
  - nephrotoxicity
  - drug combinations
  - FAERS
  - pharmacokinetics
  - risk prediction
